WEBVTT

00:07:29.987 --> 00:07:31.864
I'm not going to tell you what to do."

00:07:33.282 --> 00:07:38.454
From the day they realize

00:07:38.496 --> 00:07:41.332
and have confidence

00:07:41.332 --> 00:07:43.792
that I'm not here to judge their choices,

00:07:43.834 --> 00:07:45.836
some of them were already mothers.

00:07:47.755 --> 00:07:50.758
And you have a lot of pride

00:07:50.799 --> 00:07:54.011
when you're talking
to underprivileged people.

00:07:54.595 --> 00:07:57.473
Because I decided from the get-go

00:07:57.473 --> 00:08:01.101
to walk the dirt road
where no one wants to go